# SE Lab 4 — VibeCoding

## Project: Word Scramble Arena

**AI Tools Used:** ChatGPT and GitHub Copilot  
**Programming Language:** Python  
**Library:** Pygame

## Task-wise Implementation and Git CommitS

| Task | Description | Commit ID |
|---|---|---|
| Task 1 | Fixed the word scramble answer-validation bug | [41258b4](https://github.com/sahanagolabanvi34-debug/62_scramble/commit/41258b4) |
| Task 2 | Added Hint button with letter reveal and score deduction | [e1f4eb7](https://github.com/sahanagolabanvi34-debug/62_scramble/commit/e1f4eb7) |
| Task 3 | Added 30-second countdown timer and automatic round reset | [4fa8d7e](https://github.com/sahanagolabanvi34-debug/62_scramble/commit/4fa8d7e) |
| Task 4 | Added clickable letter tiles, Undo and Clear functionality | [49a6ef3](https://github.com/sahanagolabanvi34-debug/62_scramble/commit/49a6ef3) |

## Original Development Repository

https://github.com/sahanagolabanvi34-debug/62_scramble

Each task was implemented and committed separately in the original development repository. The links above provide the actual task-wise code changes and Git commit history.

## Lab-4 Deliverables

- Before.mp4 — Original game recording
- After.mp4 — Updated game recording
- Lab4_AI_Chat_History_Complete.pdf — AI interaction documentation
- main.py — Game entry point
- game_engine.py — Game logic
- text_box.py — Text input handling

## Execution

Install Pygame:

`python -m pip install pygame`

Run the game from the original development repository's root folder:

`python main.py`

## Conclusion

The Word Scramble game was improved by correcting answer validation, introducing progressive hints, implementing a countdown timer, and providing interactive letter selection. GitHub Copilot assisted with feature implementation, while ChatGPT supported debugging and development guidance.
